      "text": "When it folds up its body and extends its wings, it looks like a jet plane. It flies at sonic speed.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "It flies at speeds equal to a jet fighter plane. It never allows its prey to escape.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can fly at speeds rivaling jet planes. It dives into flocks of bird Pokémon and gulps the entire flock down whole.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protuberances on its head serve as sensors. It can even detect distant prey.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It flies at the speed of sound while searching for prey, and it has midair battles with Salamence as the two compete for food.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its fine scales don’t just reduce wind resistance—their sharp edges also cause injury to any opponent who attacks it.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Garchomp makes its home in volcanic mountains. It flies through the sky as fast as a jet airplane, hunting down as much prey as it can.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Garchomp is fast both underground and above. It can bring down prey and return to its den before its body has chilled from being outside.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Soars across the heavens at blinding speed—a magnificent sight! It has a feral disposition. Utmost caution is required if one meets a Garchomp out in the wilds.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
